0.145 0.388 0.922 rg
40. 268.8899999999999864 Td
(SEC-01 & SEC-02: Server Action Authentication Guards) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
40. 255.8899999999999864 Td
(Next.js server actions are publicly accessible endpoints unless explicitly protected. We added strict session authentication and tenant) Tj
T* (matching \(schoolId\) to getStudentsBySchool, addSchool, and getSchools. Unauthenticated requests are rejected with 401/403) Tj
T* (exceptions.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg
40. 207.8899999999999864 Td
(SEC-03 & SEC-09: Multi-Tenant Isolation & IDOR Elimination) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
40. 194.8899999999999864 Td
(Previously, updateScore and deleteUser allowed cross-tenant modification because they lacked tenant ownership checks. We scoped) Tj
T* (Prisma queries to verify student.class.schoolId === session.schoolId, validated obtainedMarks <= totalMarks, and restricted student) Tj
T* (modification privileges.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg
40. 146.8899999999999864 Td
(SEC-04 & SEC-05: Online Examination Security & PIN Protection) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
40. 133.8899999999999864 Td
(The exam access PIN was previously transmitted to the client browser in Server Component props. We removed accessPin from the) Tj
T* (client bundle and relocated verification entirely to a server action. Furthermore, autosaveAttempt and submitAttempt now validate the) Tj
T* (student device lock cookie and prevent tampering with completed exams.) Tj
ET
