0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
40. 763.8899999999999864 Td
(Student answers and test content were rendered with dangerouslySetInnerHTML without sanitization. We integrated) Tj
T* (isomorphic-dompurify across leaderboard-view, grading-client, and test-taking components, stripping malicious script vectors while safely) Tj
T* (preserving legitimate rich text.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg
40. 715.8899999999999864 Td
(SEC-07 & SEC-08: API Route Hardening & SSRF Defense) Tj
