/F1 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
40. 653.8899999999999864 Td
(.gitignore was hardened to strictly block all .env variants. In auth.ts, the master admin credential check was upgraded to use) Tj
T* (crypto.timingSafeEqual over UTF-8 buffers, eliminating character-by-character timing leakages. Security headers \(X-Frame-Options,) Tj
T* (X-Content-Type-Options\) were added in next.config.mjs.) Tj
ET
